@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Compatibility research consulted
+
+- **VCF Upgrade Failure: Cannot Upgrade VCF 5.2.2 to 9.0.1 or 9.0.2 Due to NSX Back-in-Time Error (NSX 4.2.3.3)** — Broadcom Knowledge Base — https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/430825 — Accessed 2026-08-14 — Confirmed that NSX 4.2.3.3 build 25171318 cannot move to the older NSX builds bundled with VCF 9.0.1 or 9.0.2, and that VCF 9.1 is the supported route around that chronological-build gate.
+- **Upgrade Sequence and Related Issues for VMware Cloud Foundation and vSphere Foundation 9.1** — Broadcom Knowledge Base — https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/440630/upgrade-sequence-and-related-issues-for.html — Accessed 2026-08-14 — Confirmed that a VCF 5.2.x estate upgrades VCF Operations first and then uses VCF lifecycle workflows for the 9.1 component sequence.
+- **Broadcom Product Interoperability Matrix** — Broadcom — https://interopmatrix.broadcom.com/Interoperability — Accessed 2026-08-14 — Consulted the product interoperability and upgrade-path matrices for the vCenter, ESXi, and NSX combinations represented by the inventory and target release.
+- **VMware Cloud Foundation API specifications, tag 9.1.0.0** — VMware on GitHub — https://github.com/vmware/vcf-api-specs/tree/9.1.0.0/specifications/vcf-installer — Accessed 2026-08-14 — Confirmed the provenance and version of the installer OpenAPI `SddcSpec` used for the greenfield artifact.
